# Project Standards

This project's full AI-assistant guidance lives in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root — read it before
making changes. `CLAUDE.md` is a symlink to the same file.

Key points (see AGENTS.md for full detail):
- Architecture: Facade (`AddressService`), Protocol-based interfaces, Factory (`ParserFactory`,
  `DataSourceFactory`), Composite (`CompositeValidator`), Builder (`AddressBuilder`).
- Do not redesign architecture without explicit approval.
- Use Context7 to resolve third-party library APIs (Pydantic, usaddress, pandas, Typer) rather
  than relying on memory — this project pins specific versions.
- Run `uv run pytest`, `uv run ruff check`, `uv run mypy src` before considering a change done.

See also `01-python.mdc` and `02-tests.mdc` for language- and test-specific rules.
